s trip didn't need manager approval.\n\n**What went wrong along the way:** My first booking request timed out. When I retried it, the system said the flight had been booked and charged ($289, R0001) but the hotel booking had failed. I cancelled that flight booking and refunded it, then sent the full request again, and it went through. I checked Dana's reservations afterward. The only confirmed bookings are R0002 and R0003, and R0001 shows as cancelled, so nothing was double-booked or double-charged.", "type": "text"}]}]}